<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your experience in {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">I regret we were unable to carry you on flight QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c}. I do understand how concerning this would have been for you and would like to apologise for the impact this had on your plans.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Where flights have been overbooked, airlines are responsible to provide customers with alternative flights to get them to their destination or offer a full refund if they decide they no longer wish to travel.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Your comments about the way this was handled have been forwarded to our Airport Management for review of our oversale handling procedures. We appreciate you taking the time to provide your first-hand experience. Feedback like yours is vital to developing our service, so we are grateful you took the time to let us know what happened.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><i><font size="2">-If requesting compensation add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">You will need to refer any unexpected costs arising from the delay to your travel insurance provider. If you require any additional information about the delay to make a claim through your policy, please let me know by replying to this email, and I would be happy to provide this letter.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">We are putting every effort into minimising disruptions and we hope you’ll see the difference the next time you travel.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="2" style="" color="#ffffff"><br></font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2" style="" color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>